    "body": "## Summary\n- add a bounded per-principal STOMP inbound rate limiter after websocket authentication/authorization\n- keep CONNECT/DISCONNECT outside the message budget while protecting SEND/SUBSCRIBE and other authenticated inbound frames\n- expose safe production tuning knobs with validated bounds and fail-closed entry-capacity behavior\n- document the application-vs-ingress abuse-protection boundary\n- add regression tests for limiting, principal isolation and configuration validation\n\n## Validation\nCI is required before merge: Maven/API verify, web test/lint/build, production Compose contract and runtime smokes. No Flyway migration is needed because this slice adds no persistent state.",
